OL,3,GNEWSAWhen is the election and how do I
OL,4,Avote?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man general election takes
OL,7,Fplace on Thursday 24 September.
OL,9,FVoters go to the polls every five years
OL,10,Fto elect 24 members of the House of
OL,11,FKeys (MHKs).
OL,13,FThere are 82 candidates standing.
OL,15,FBut how do you vote in the Isle of Man
OL,16,Felection and when will the results be
OL,17,Fknown?
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
